      propertyPath: m_text
      value: This is a NAND Gate, it is one of the two universal logic gates.  It
        is the opposite version of the AND Gate. If both signals are 1/On , the output
        would be 0/Off and if both signals are 0/ff the output would be 1/On. This
        also acts similar with the OR Gate which means it also works if only one
        of the signals are 1/On, the output  would be 1/On
